1
00:01:58,030 --> 00:02:04,360
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:08,570
No living creature was harmed during
the production of this series

3
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:16,159
Do you want to dethrone Sultan Alaeddin...

4
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,359
...because he supported me?

5
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:25,159
You being against me means that
I am on the right way.

6
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:28,599
I will bring you death on your right way.

7
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,319
Give.

8
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,159
Stop!

9
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,159
-Nayman.
-Why?

10
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:31,319
While we are living in Bursa in peace..

11
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,519
Our enemies are making moves.

12
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:39,759
Right now, in Konya..

13
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:44,159
Osman is trying to enthrone Mesut who supports him.

14
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:49,919
Sir, Osman is daydreaming.

15
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:52,759
Konya is under the rule of Gazan Khan.

16
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,679
He can't do that.

17
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:58,119
Exactly, Commander Faustus.

18
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,879
Exactly.

19
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,519
The biggest mistake we can make..

20
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,999
Is looking down on our enemy.

21
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:15,999
Osman is thinking what you think.

22
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:21,239
A caravan from Tabriz, is moving
towards Konya right now.

23
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,239
Do not..

24
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:39,719
Ever feel let dusk fall on your hearts.

25
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:45,159
And answer me.

26
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,399
Are you ready to spill blood?

27
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:53,119
Our swords has waited enough
in their sheats, Lord Valens.

28
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,119
Today..

29
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,199
We will strike on four sides.

30
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:03,279
We will defeat all of his supporters.

31
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,599
While Osman is not here.

32
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:11,119
Who will we rain hell to, my Lord?

33
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,839
Those who live in tribes.

34
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,479
You.

35
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:37,599
You will march to Kizilbey Tribe.

36
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,719
You..

37
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:44,119
You will destroy Cavuldur Tribe

38
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,599
And you two..

39
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:50,119
You will destroy Demirkhan and Uraz.

40
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,559
Commander Faustus!

41
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,719
You will come with me.

42
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:03,599
We will destroy Osman's biggest legion together.

43
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:10,559
Today, rip down mercy from your heart.

44
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:14,959
The women of those sheep are also fighters.

45
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,519
Their children, hold grudges.

46
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:24,799
When they grow up, they seek revenge.

47
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,359
And elderly..

48
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,759
They are wise and experienced.

49
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,799
No mercy!

50
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:37,159
Let none alive.

51
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:41,399
Today, show no mercy for anyone.

52
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:45,039
No one will be taken captive, come on!

53
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,919
Osman.

54
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:20,039
This Bayindir and Mesut.

55
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:27,119
This treachery, can not be silenced.

56
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,279
This is a waste of time.

57
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:35,318
I manage a community, Nayman.

58
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:39,038
To not let this kind of treachery happen again..

59
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:43,798
I will behead them all to make an example.

60
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:55,279
I will skin this one.

61
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:02,239
They did a move..

62
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:06,239
And they received nothing in return except for failure.

63
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:11,599
I will hang their corpses for weeks in Konya.

64
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,719
That is, of course..

65
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,439
If Sultan allows it.

66
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,599
Why uncle?

67
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,479
Why?

68
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,039
You want this throne that much?

69
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:34,799
What throne are you talking about Alaaddin?

70
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,039
The only thing I wanted to interfere..

71
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:41,079
Is doing business with Nayman.

72
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,679
What about you, Osman Bey?

73
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,879
Is this your way?

74
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:53,199
To betray who raised you?

75
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,759
Sultan Alaeddin.

76
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,759
I grew up under the shadow of Seljuk State.

77
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,679
Because I grew up under its shadow..

78
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,799
I was a Bey worthy of traditions.

79
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,239
What about you?

80
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:16,559
You became blind as you grew up
under the shadow of Mother Sultan.

81
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,679
Mother Sultan..

82
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,759
Neither sees..

83
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,639
nor shows truth to you.

84
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,599
Because of her hunger for power.

85
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:33,239
Truth you say?

86
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,079
Truth is what my eyes see.

87
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:40,119
There is no one but traitors in front of me right now.

88
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,639
You..

89
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:47,159
You've betrayed the Sultan of Seljuk State.

90
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:53,919
My mother asked
if I approved your death penalty.

91
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:58,119
My answer is..

92
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,119
Whatever Mother Sultan says.

93
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:10,199
Tomorrow, this will be done after the sun rises.

94
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,439
Take them away!

95
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,759
Until Osman's head is cut off...

96
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,519
No one will enter Konya, Bendu.

97
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:13,119
We put Osman in the cage.

98
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,319
He will lose his head soon.

99
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:18,079
Why are you worried, Commander Nayman?

100
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,479
We put the sheep in the cage...

101
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:25,439
...but we will not stop being careful.

102
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:30,119
Until Osman's head is cut off..

103
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:33,799
...I will have the east and the west in my hands.

104
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:37,919
You will hold the east, Bendu.

105
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:43,239
Gazan Khan might make a move to weaken...

106
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:45,919
...the people in Konya.

107
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,599
If he makes a move..

108
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:52,839
...we will crush them before arriving in Konya.

109
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:56,159
Come on.

110
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:04,359
Celali! You know your limits, right?

111
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,199
I do, my Sultan.

112
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:12,399
That's why you lived for so long.

113
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:19,439
That's why you served Konya for all your life.

114
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:23,159
Those who know their limits live long.

115
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:29,359
But that Osman never knew his limits.

116
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:35,759
Mother Sultan...
Forgive me, but..

117
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,559
...why didn't we kill him there?

118
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,959
Unfortunately...

119
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:46,759
...Osman has a reputation among Turkmens.

120
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,319
If he does not die next to Mesud...

121
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:53,159
...his treason cannot be proven.

122
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,239
Thus..

123
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:58,719
...there won't be a silent death.

124
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:02,279
His death will teach a lesson to everyone.

125
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:06,799
It will, so his dead body...

126
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,439
...will be announced as a traitor.

127
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,479
Soldiers!

128
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,319
Celali.

129
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:36,639
But there is such a person that...

130
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:42,879
..he won't die easily.

131
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:56,319
Until I get rid of my anger...

132
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,519
...you will not stop, Celali.

133
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:45,639
At the beginning, we were on the wrong way.

134
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:49,359
But we fell on the right way.

135
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:54,159
Being forgiven by you..

136
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:57,359
.means nothing to me.

137
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:02,839
May Allah forgive this poor man.

138
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,599
You were with me when I was playing all those...

139
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,279
..games..

140
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:13,719
Do you think you are on the right way just because you...

141
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:17,319
...stood against me in one of those games, Bayindir?

142
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,799
No.

143
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,999
Not everyone who looks for it cannot find it...

144
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:30,359
...but everyone who found it must have looked for it at one point.

145
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,559
I did not tell you that I reached the right way.

146
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:38,159
I said I fell on the right way.

147
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:41,159
Ismihan Hatun.

148
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,679
I will not hear anything but his screams of...

149
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,559
..pain, Celali.

150
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,759
Take him!

151
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:18,559
We failed, huh, Osman Bey?

152
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:30,279
Who said that, Sultan Mesud?

153
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,919
We have not lost yet.

154
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:38,519
You would not make a move before planning
a game in another game, my Bey.

155
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:42,279
Osman Bey...
We are already miserable in this dungeon.

156
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,199
Do not lock us in our curiosity.

157
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:52,719
Unfortunately, Konya is under
Gazan Khan's control.

158
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:56,319
Unless we receive an order
or a will from him...

159
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:58,879
...your throne will not be rightful.

160
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:04,959
I told Gazan Khan that Nayman
and Ismihan are working together...

161
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:08,959
...and that they are trying to drag
Sultan Alaeddin into the game.

162
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:14,919
Sheikh Edebali and Turgut
went to Tabriz for this.

163
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:20,719
Gazan Khan will send a troop
and take us out of here.

164
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:26,359
If Allah permits, he will let you
sit on the throne of Konya.

165
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,799
Osman Bey...

166
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,799
You planned your move with details again.

167
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:35,159
You did that, but...

168
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:39,039
...what if that army cannot
arrive in Konya?

169
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:43,279
My Bey...

170
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:46,679
Do we depend on the army that Gazan will send?

171
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:51,119
What if they cannot arrive on time?
What are we going to do then, my Bey?

172
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:54,599
Then we will come together with the ultimate ending.

173
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,999
We will drink the sherbet of shahada.

174
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:03,039
But no... We won't die easily.

175
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:08,639
We have valiants like Salancu and Korkmaz,
although they are not crowded.

176
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:12,399
Now... They will give us swords.

177
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,639
And we will fight at the risk of our lives.

178
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,199
Thank you.

179
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,759
You are coming with us, Osman Bey.

180
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:29,679
Where is Osman Bey going, brother?

181
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:33,559
can come.
-Alps, wait.

182
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:36,279
Wait. Come here.

183
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:48,079
Come here.

184
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:11,079
There is no need to be worried.

185
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,879
Be careful.

186
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:18,439
We will either succeed or die.

187
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:38,959
We've made good money recently.

188
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:52,559
We'll racketeer much more.

189
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,479
Where are we going next?

190
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:02,359
We'll visit all the villages
around to racketeer.

191
00:22:05,040 --> 00:22:07,239
Our pouches will be full of coins.

192
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:10,759
Come on.

193
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:20,039
Folks!

194
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:23,079
You've filled your stomachs.

195
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:25,839
You can't leave without paying.

196
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:31,559
Look at him! He's talking to us!

197
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,119
Be grateful that we didn't kill you.

198
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,719
Buzz off!

199
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:52,119
If you don't pay, don't come here again!

200
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:54,359
No food for free!

201
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:57,679
Maybe I will, maybe I won't.
It's none of your business!

202
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:04,599
Your mouth is too big for an innkeeper.

203
00:23:04,840 --> 00:23:06,839
Let's take care of that.

204
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:11,399
Leave my son! Just get out of here.

205
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,719
Leave the boy.

206
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:28,159
ForumKayi.com

207
00:24:12,520 --> 00:24:14,839
Gazan Khan's commander.

208
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:19,839
You are Esrigun Banu.

209
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:22,599
Bala Hatun,

210
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:26,159
...daughter of Sheikh Edebali,
wife of Osman Bey.

211
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:30,999
I heard your reputation
from your father Sheikh Edebali.

212
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:35,439
-He sent salaam for you.
-Aleykum selam.

213
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:41,799
Did they know who you are?

214
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:48,839
In usual stories, heroes save
the innkeeper's daughter.

215
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:51,599
I saved the innkeeper's son today.

216
00:24:56,320 --> 00:24:58,519
You've rested long enough!

217
00:24:59,080 --> 00:25:01,159
We came here to solve a problem.

218
00:25:01,280 --> 00:25:02,839
We can go now.

219
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:07,279
Come on, Sisters! Tell the alps
to prepare the wagons.

220
00:25:14,760 --> 00:25:17,759
May Allah's greetings be upon you.

221
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:21,999
May Allah's greetings be upon you.

222
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:40,559
O The Most Generous!

223
00:25:41,760 --> 00:25:44,319
O my Merciful Allah!

224
00:25:45,320 --> 00:25:46,719
My Allah..

225
00:25:47,920 --> 00:25:50,159
I've come to You.

226
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:53,239
The cruel keep tyrannizing.

227
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:56,399
The darkness keeps living in dungeons.

228
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:57,839
But...

229
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:01,679
But Your light is eternal, my Allah.

230
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:05,879
Your Mercy is eternal, my Allah.

231
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,879
Allah.

232
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:12,319
Save me from this darkness, my Allah.

233
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:18,079
You have all the belongings and the sovereignty.

234
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:23,239
My cause is being away from the evil and wrong.

235
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:27,519
My only cause is spreading..

236
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:30,919
...the words of Quran in the whole world.

237
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:34,399
My Allah, help me get rid of...

238
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:38,439
...all the obstacles against my cause.

239
00:26:38,840 --> 00:26:41,759
My Allah, let me and my kin..

240
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:44,839
..be servants of Islam.

241
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:47,599
Accept my prayers, my Allah.

242
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:58,439
We equipped Konya like
an impassable army, Mother Sultan.

243
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:02,199
And we placed the loyal soldiers...

244
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:05,839
...in the secret passages as you ordered.

245
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:11,079
And we laid traps in the passages
as a precaution.

246
00:27:16,800 --> 00:27:19,639
If anyone comes through those passages,

247
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:23,439
...it will be their graves!

248
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:26,679
What about soldiers?

249
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,439
Did they mingle with the people?

250
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:31,519
Yes, Mother Sultan.

251
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:35,399
In case of an attack they will agitate...

252
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:38,199
...and make the people attack all together.

253
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:40,719
Good.

254
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:44,839
Neither a sword nor
a commander can capture...

255
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:49,079
...a city that has become
a whole with its people.

256
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:54,519
What are we taking measures against, Mother Sultan?
Won't you let us know?

257
00:27:54,840 --> 00:27:58,079
Measures are always required, Celali.

258
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:03,239
Both Mesud and Osman will be beheaded.

259
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:07,879
I will show my power to the whole world...

260
00:28:08,600 --> 00:28:12,039
So if anyone makes a move to save them,

261
00:28:12,520 --> 00:28:15,039
...I will destroy their courage.

262
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:23,239
Until Mesud's head falls down

263
00:28:23,280 --> 00:28:27,719
...you will always be with my Sultan son, Celali.

264
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:34,199
Some will intend to leave the palace without
a Sultan and Konya without a head.

265
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:37,639
You will drown them in their own blood.

266
00:28:40,280 --> 00:28:41,799
Now let's go..

267
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:45,399
...and talk to my Sultan son before
the executions tomorrow.

268
00:28:46,120 --> 00:28:48,599
Sultan Alaaddin isn't in his chamber.

269
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:52,279
Where is he?

270
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,119
What is it, Mighty Sultan?

271
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:18,239
You wanted to see your servant
Osman in the dungeon?

272
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:23,559
Neither I see Osman as my servant...

273
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:26,719
...nor does Osman accept me as a Sultan.

274
00:29:28,520 --> 00:29:30,719
You're just a traitor, Osman.

275
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:33,599
Mighty Sultan..

276
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:37,119
The state isn't ruled by you..

277
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:40,279
..but by Mother Sultan.

278
00:29:40,520 --> 00:29:42,839
All the soldiers obey her.

279
00:29:44,520 --> 00:29:47,359
But you are just ignoring that.

280
00:29:49,320 --> 00:29:51,679
I can't serve that.

281
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:54,199
And what is so-called traitor Nayman doing?

282
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:56,959
He's protecting my throne.

283
00:29:59,520 --> 00:30:03,879
And fighting against the rioters within the state.

284
00:30:05,040 --> 00:30:09,309
Supposedly, Nayman is the enemy.
And what about you? An ally, Osman?

285
00:30:17,560 --> 00:30:19,719
Mighty Sultan!

286
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:27,119
I'm the enemy of everyone
who is against Turks and Islam.

287
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,359
But..

288
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:33,719
You claim I'm a rioter.

289
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:35,719
So tell me..

290
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:38,919
What did I riot against?

291
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:42,199
Against me, Osman!

292
00:30:44,520 --> 00:30:46,599
Sultan Alaaddin.

293
00:30:47,040 --> 00:30:49,879
I have no hostility against you.

294
00:30:50,160 --> 00:30:54,959
But you are ignoring
Mother Sultan's evil games.

295
00:30:57,280 --> 00:30:58,919
Tell me...

296
00:30:59,360 --> 00:31:01,639
How did you ascend the throne?

297
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:05,159
Are you questioning the legitimacy
of my sultanate now?

298
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:09,399
Sultan Mesud wanted to make Konya free.

299
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:15,239
He wanted to break Mongolians.

300
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:19,079
But Mongolians...

301
00:31:19,280 --> 00:31:22,759
...wanted a Sultan who would do
whatever they wanted.

302
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:28,839
So Mother Sultan made
a deal with Mongolians.

303
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:34,239
That's how you ascended the throne,
Mighty Sultan.

304
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:39,079
Tell me.

305
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:42,479
What did you do...

306
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:45,399
..for the cause of Turks?

307
00:31:45,560 --> 00:31:47,639
What's the cause of Turks?

308
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:50,479
My cause is the freedom cause of Turks.

309
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:53,039
If Konya is to be taken captured,

310
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:56,039
...then the frontiers will remain free.

311
00:31:57,440 --> 00:31:59,639
If Konya is to be crushed,

312
00:31:59,760 --> 00:32:02,199
...then the frontiers will rise.

313
00:32:03,800 --> 00:32:06,559
If one hand leaves the flag,

314
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:09,399
..the other hand will carry it.

315
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:13,039
That's how we've existed so far.

316
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:16,599
And so will we forever.

317
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:23,439
YENI SEHIR
OSMAN BEY'S MANSION

318
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:37,439
Do you know what threw Hadrat Ibrahim to fire?

319
00:32:40,040 --> 00:32:42,399
Because he broke the idols, Kumral Abdal.

320
00:32:49,000 --> 00:32:50,239
No.

321
00:32:54,040 --> 00:32:56,999
Because he didn't prostrate to Nimrod.

322
00:33:03,360 --> 00:33:04,999
That Nimrod...

323
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:10,879
...saw himself as the God of his people.

324
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:19,239
When they took...

325
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:23,359
...Hadrat Ibrahim to him with
the crime of breaking the idols...

326
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:28,919
...Nimrod wanted him to prostrate.

327
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:37,519
When Hadrat Ibrahim told Nimrod that...

328
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:41,559
..."I swear that I will not prostrate to...

329
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:45,279
...anyone but my Creator
who created you and me...

330
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,799
...and all the worlds"...

331
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,759
he showed his side.

332
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:56,039
Maybe he would forgive what was done to the idols,

333
00:33:57,840 --> 00:34:02,199
but the greatest idol was Nimrod's nafs (self).

334
00:34:04,840 --> 00:34:08,998
Hadrat Ibrahim hit Nimrod's nafs...

335
00:34:09,560 --> 00:34:12,158
...with his toughest sword.

336
00:34:17,719 --> 00:34:20,478
Nimrod was so panicked that...

337
00:34:21,440 --> 00:34:23,998
so panicked that...

338
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:27,599
in front of his people...

339
00:34:28,679 --> 00:34:31,559
his nafs was damaged so heavily that...

340
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:36,119
He said "start a fire right away!"

341
00:34:37,159 --> 00:34:40,599
Start a vast fire
that has never seen before.

342
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:45,438
A fire to burn Hadrat Ibrahim!

343
00:34:45,960 --> 00:34:48,119
A huge fire!

344
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,999
If Hadrat Ibrahim...

345
00:35:16,720 --> 00:35:18,799
had turned away from the path of Haqq

346
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:22,199
and prostrated to Nimrod,

347
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:25,999
that fire wouldn't have been set.

348
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:30,279
But how could he?

349
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:38,959
Is it possible to turn away from Haqq
for people like Nimrod?

350
00:35:40,160 --> 00:35:41,439
No.

351
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,959
No.

352
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:48,199
Of course not.

353
00:35:49,720 --> 00:35:53,399
Ibrahim knocked all the idols down.

354
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:57,919
Ibrahim screamed
"I don't like the ones that sink away"

355
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:04,239
"I accept no Creator but the One
that is Eternal and Infinite".

356
00:36:08,080 --> 00:36:11,839
And he walked towards the fire
that Nimrod started...

357
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:17,839
...without a shadow of fear in his heart.

358
00:36:23,520 --> 00:36:25,999
Do you know why?

359
00:36:38,080 --> 00:36:42,159
He knew that the fire
wouldn't burn him.

360
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:01,479
This is how you become Ibrahim.

361
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:05,919
Nimrod's fire is torture

362
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:11,479
and Ibrahim is the justice
that is not burnt in that fire.

363
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:17,639
Justice is gold.

364
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:21,119
No matter how big the fire of cruelty is...

365
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:24,279
...no matter how fierce it is...

366
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:30,279
...gold will still be the same gold.

367
00:37:35,280 --> 00:37:38,759
It only clears away the dirt.

368
00:37:42,240 --> 00:37:43,439
We should...

369
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:48,559
...be gold as Ibrahim,
free from all the dirts...

370
00:37:50,520 --> 00:37:52,599
so that the fire of Nimrods

371
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:56,559
cannot find anything to burn
inside us.

372
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:05,159
Sultan Alaeddin.

373
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:09,359
Nayman keeps setting up his tricks.

374
00:38:09,560 --> 00:38:11,079
But...

375
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:14,239
...but you cannot see it.

376
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:20,239
As you can't...

377
00:38:20,720 --> 00:38:23,039
...carrying this banner
is beyond your ability.

378
00:38:23,480 --> 00:38:25,119
How dare you?

379
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:30,759
You think that Konya
cannot hold the banner, is that so?

380
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:35,439
You can't because you
side with the enemy...

381
00:38:36,040 --> 00:38:37,799
and damage Turks.

382
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:42,879
You are not seeing the truth, mighty Sultan.

383
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,959
Nayman..

384
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:50,359
...wants to cooperate
with the Lord of Bursa.

385
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:53,559
First he will raid the Frontiers.

386
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:57,519
And then he will move towards Konya, but...

387
00:38:58,440 --> 00:39:01,239
...but you will not be able to see it.

388
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:07,319
Do you have a proof?

389
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:09,639
I don't need proof.

390
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:12,119
Don't worry.

391
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,999
I will not let it happen.

392
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:21,399
Even if what you said is true...

393
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:25,039
...You will not be able to
stop any of them, Osman.

394
00:39:28,040 --> 00:39:29,119
I will.

395
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:34,679
You will be executed today.

396
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:38,239
Hadrat Sultan.

397
00:39:38,720 --> 00:39:42,679
Are we in Mongol lands
that you are trying to break us?

398
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:45,519
This is the price of rebellion!

399
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,839
The throne will eventually be mine.

400
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:52,599
Konya will break the chains of Mongols.

401
00:39:52,720 --> 00:39:54,799
Let him deal with the Lord of Bursa.

402
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:57,919
I will put an end to all of them in no time.

403
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:04,119
When I had never dropped the Turkish banner,

404
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:08,359
you shouldn't have tried to take
the banner from me, Osman.

405
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:15,399
One of your hands is with the enemy
and the other one holds the banner.

406
00:40:17,440 --> 00:40:19,479
This is not right, mighty Sultan.

407
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:23,039
This does not suit the cause of Turks.

408
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:55,119
Slowly, Huseyin, slowly.

409
00:40:56,080 --> 00:40:57,959
This is my life.

410
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:09,119
Where is my Osman Bey brother?

411
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:11,359
Tell me!

412
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,839
Where did you take my Bey?

413
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:18,159
Just wait for us to leave, then I'll tear off your hearts!

414
00:41:18,640 --> 00:41:20,879
I'll cut your
tongues one by one!

415
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:27,519
We shouldn't have left my Bey,
The Mother must have a move.

416
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,559
Or why would she take my Bey?

417
00:41:30,320 --> 00:41:34,279
If they attempt anything evil, I'll turn Konya into a hell for them.

418
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:47,199
Are you ready for martyrdom, brave boys?

419
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:14,999
-Tell me brother, who are you?
-We are loyal to Commander Korkmaz.

420
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:18,559
We pledged to Sultan Mesut.

421
00:42:19,320 --> 00:42:21,479
Thank you, valiants.

422
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:26,959
Our state will be saved
thanks to the soldiers like you.

423
00:42:30,040 --> 00:42:33,159
Tell me brother, where is my Osman Bey?

424
00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:36,319
They threw him into the dungeon,
that's all we know.

425
00:43:00,280 --> 00:43:01,519
Commander Nayman.

426
00:43:03,320 --> 00:43:04,319
Come on in.

427
00:43:16,280 --> 00:43:20,719
Our scouts heard that a group of people
came from Tebriz, great Nayman.

428
00:43:21,800 --> 00:43:22,919
Who?

429
00:43:24,480 --> 00:43:26,839
Who is that man that I will kill?

430
00:43:27,360 --> 00:43:29,199
I don't know Commander Nayman.

431
00:43:29,200 --> 00:43:31,679
Soldiers are looking for them.

432
00:43:40,960 --> 00:43:44,719
That group shall never reach Konya.

433
00:43:47,200 --> 00:43:49,599
Osman will lose his head.

434
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:52,759
Only I will rule in Konya.

435
00:43:54,000 --> 00:43:56,479
No one will stop this.

436
00:43:58,400 --> 00:44:00,639
I don't want any incompetency.

437
00:44:01,040 --> 00:44:03,719
I want the heads of those people.

438
00:44:04,760 --> 00:44:06,079
Come on!

439
00:44:46,360 --> 00:44:48,719
No one whose head is on his shoulders...

440
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:51,839
...will arrive in Konya.

441
00:44:52,720 --> 00:44:54,319
Kill everyone!

442
00:44:54,800 --> 00:44:56,599
Do not show mercy to anyone.

443
00:44:56,920 --> 00:44:59,519
Soldiers! Attack!

444
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:10,439
Soldiers! Attack!

445
00:45:10,720 --> 00:45:12,399
Protect the Princess!

446
00:45:40,960 --> 00:45:42,839
Your end has come, Princess.

447
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:06,839
Soldiers! Trap! Run!

448
00:46:06,920 --> 00:46:08,319
They are running!

449
00:46:33,200 --> 00:46:34,439
So it is time.

450
00:46:37,160 --> 00:46:40,679
If you allow me, before I set out...
-Don't worry, Bengi.

451
00:46:42,160 --> 00:46:44,079
I know what you are going to say.

452
00:46:45,400 --> 00:46:48,399
We are not setting out now.
We will first go to your tribe...

453
00:46:48,960 --> 00:46:51,559
...so you can ask for your people's pardon.

454
00:46:55,760 --> 00:46:57,719
There is no need for that, Bengi Hatun.

455
00:47:00,600 --> 00:47:02,799
No... They should tie them.

456
00:47:03,480 --> 00:47:06,559
They should tie them, so I can be punished.

457
00:47:07,240 --> 00:47:08,519
Tie them..

458
00:47:09,080 --> 00:47:12,799
...so my greed which I could not
defeat will be slapped again.

459
00:47:13,560 --> 00:47:14,999
Tie them.

460
00:47:26,760 --> 00:47:29,719
Your conscience is making you
suffer the most, Bengi.

461
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:33,079
There is no need for further punishment.

462
00:47:45,640 --> 00:47:48,439
Come on. Let's go.
Our children are waiting for us.

463
00:49:40,600 --> 00:49:43,199
I wanted to kill you like a soldier...

464
00:49:43,480 --> 00:49:46,039
..in the battlefield.

465
00:49:46,600 --> 00:49:50,799
But...
you chose dying like a traitor.

466
00:49:51,600 --> 00:49:54,519
You think one can only fight in the battlefield.

467
00:49:56,240 --> 00:49:58,079
That's why you will lose in the end.

468
00:49:58,680 --> 00:50:01,799
Those are brave sentences for a person...

469
00:50:02,600 --> 00:50:05,559
...who will lose his head soon, Osman.

470
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:08,079
You lost.

471
00:50:08,880 --> 00:50:10,959
Only Allah knows that.

472
00:50:23,200 --> 00:50:26,159
Those shameless men
who betrayed the state of Seljuk...

473
00:50:27,560 --> 00:50:29,679
...will die here today.

474
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:34,199
They wanted to dethrone Sultan Alaeddin...

475
00:50:34,880 --> 00:50:36,159
...and replace him with..

476
00:50:37,040 --> 00:50:39,799
..Mesud, who cannot even..

477
00:50:41,200 --> 00:50:43,679
...help himself.

478
00:50:52,120 --> 00:50:54,439
They deceived our Commanders!

479
00:50:54,840 --> 00:50:58,679
No one should keep treason in their hearts!

480
00:51:02,320 --> 00:51:04,799
Those who betray...

481
00:51:05,960 --> 00:51:07,359
...will die like them.

482
00:51:08,840 --> 00:51:11,479
First, the leader of the traitors...

483
00:51:12,960 --> 00:51:15,399
...who spread the fire of rebellion...

484
00:51:16,840 --> 00:51:19,039
...and will die with his sins....

485
00:51:19,760 --> 00:51:21,199
...Osman Bey.

486
00:51:32,000 --> 00:51:34,039
Our desire to fight...

487
00:51:36,040 --> 00:51:38,399
..was never against the state of Seljuk.

488
00:51:41,760 --> 00:51:45,079
We were against the ones
who worked with the cruel.

489
00:51:54,240 --> 00:51:55,759
O, people!

490
00:51:57,680 --> 00:52:01,079
Do not forget who allied
with that cruel Nayman.

491
00:52:04,560 --> 00:52:07,959
Do not forget how they oppressed us.

492
00:52:11,120 --> 00:52:15,199
For every drop of blood that was shed,
flare up the fire of revenge.

493
00:52:16,280 --> 00:52:17,479
Because..

494
00:52:19,960 --> 00:52:21,879
..when we fall..

495
00:52:24,120 --> 00:52:26,119
..you will stand up.

496
00:52:26,360 --> 00:52:29,399
-Kill him now!
-Stop there.

497
00:53:22,760 --> 00:53:25,999
I bear witness that there is no deity but Allah...

498
00:53:26,880 --> 00:53:30,959
...and I bear witness that Muhammed
(PBUH) is His servant and His Messenger.

499
00:53:50,480 --> 00:53:51,919
Bala!

500
00:53:57,120 --> 00:53:58,759
My Osman!

501
00:54:06,320 --> 00:54:07,999
Esrigun..

502
00:54:08,920 --> 00:54:10,759
Nayman must be holding the ways.

503
00:54:11,800 --> 00:54:14,759
You will bring Princess Esrigun to Kartalsuyu.

504
00:54:14,920 --> 00:54:17,519
And we will get rid of those soldiers
and join you.

505
00:54:23,600 --> 00:54:24,799
Who are you?

506
00:54:25,000 --> 00:54:27,159
Gazan Khan's adopted daughter...

507
00:54:28,280 --> 00:54:30,679
...and his most talented Commander...

508
00:54:32,480 --> 00:54:33,919
Whoever you are..

509
00:54:34,560 --> 00:54:36,919
...you cannot come into Konya's palace...

510
00:54:37,720 --> 00:54:40,879
...without an allowance and with a traitor by your side!

511
00:54:42,720 --> 00:54:45,399
Konya is the property of Gazan Khan, Ismihan.

512
00:54:47,760 --> 00:54:49,399
And Osman Bey...

513
00:54:51,120 --> 00:54:53,079
...is Gazan Khan's friend.

514
00:55:09,040 --> 00:55:12,479
Your soldiers should sharpen
their swords, Faustus.

515
00:55:13,640 --> 00:55:14,839
We're close.

516
00:55:15,080 --> 00:55:18,959
We sharpened our swords
with our anger, my Lord.

517
00:55:20,280 --> 00:55:22,839
We will show no mercy to Turks.

518
00:55:23,360 --> 00:55:24,599
Good.

519
00:55:25,480 --> 00:55:29,799
We will destroy all who support Osman.

520
00:55:31,920 --> 00:55:35,519
If Osman succeeds in Konya..

521
00:55:36,400 --> 00:55:39,959
He will not find anyone capable of
fighting when he comes here.

522
00:55:43,600 --> 00:55:47,039
My Lord, you still haven't told us
where we're attacking.

523
00:55:48,840 --> 00:55:51,079
We will attack Kargin Tribe.

524
00:55:51,680 --> 00:55:54,879
We will destroy who comes before us.

525
00:56:09,720 --> 00:56:12,639
Konya is a state of Islam.

526
00:56:14,600 --> 00:56:16,719
It seems Osman Bey has sent a letter.

527
00:56:19,720 --> 00:56:22,199
I confirm the letter.

528
00:56:22,720 --> 00:56:23,799
However..

529
00:56:24,960 --> 00:56:27,999
Instead of Sultan, his mother speaks.

530
00:56:36,240 --> 00:56:39,759
Nayman, who rebelled and became a Khan, is also here.

531
00:56:42,240 --> 00:56:45,679
Palace of Konya will be your tomb,
you arrogant Hatun!

532
00:56:49,360 --> 00:56:51,919
To you as well, Bala Hatun.

533
00:56:55,760 --> 00:56:57,639
Mother Sultan.

534
00:57:03,840 --> 00:57:05,679
Surrender.

535
00:57:09,720 --> 00:57:11,679
So no more blood would be shed.

536
00:57:17,680 --> 00:57:21,359
Valiants!

537
00:57:21,640 --> 00:57:23,479
Swords!

538
00:57:24,440 --> 00:57:26,199
Ya Allah!

539
00:58:19,240 --> 00:58:21,479
You will stop making coins for now.

540
00:58:21,800 --> 00:58:24,799
Osman Bey will tell you what to do, after he arrives.

541
00:58:25,280 --> 00:58:27,199
As you command, Malhun Hatun.

542
00:58:27,960 --> 00:58:31,039
Malhun Hatun! Malhun Hatun!

543
00:58:32,040 --> 00:58:33,999
What is it Gokluce?

544
00:58:37,880 --> 00:58:39,119
What happened?

545
00:58:39,960 --> 00:58:42,319
Bursa's Lord has attacked in four sides.

546
00:58:43,040 --> 00:58:44,479
What are you saying?

547
00:58:44,920 --> 00:58:46,679
Tribes send words.

548
00:58:47,000 --> 00:58:49,559
Uraz Bey, Demirhan Bey, all sent words.

549
00:58:52,720 --> 00:58:54,119
It is not good.

550
00:58:56,320 --> 00:58:58,719
Valiants, ready horses!

551
00:59:07,520 --> 00:59:09,759
One group is also heading Karkin.

552
00:59:10,920 --> 00:59:13,599
Orhan, Alaeddin come on we're leaving.

553
00:59:14,000 --> 00:59:16,319
Ulgen, send word to Kumral Abdal.

554
00:59:16,440 --> 00:59:19,239
Send word to all healers everyone to tribes.

555
00:59:19,800 --> 00:59:22,919
Gokluce, Inegol, Bilecik, Karacahisar..

556
00:59:22,920 --> 00:59:25,639
Send word to everywhere, tell them to be cautious.

557
00:59:25,640 --> 00:59:27,159
Come on my children.

558
01:00:05,280 --> 01:00:06,519
Ismihan.

559
01:00:07,160 --> 01:00:11,759
If Esrigun is here, then Konya wants me to bow down.

560
01:00:12,400 --> 01:00:14,759
Konya still belongs to Gazan, Ismihan.

561
01:00:15,040 --> 01:00:16,879
We need to step back.

562
01:00:18,240 --> 01:00:19,999
Konya is mine.

563
01:00:20,240 --> 01:00:22,919
I will die but not surrender it, Nayman.

564
01:00:23,080 --> 01:00:27,799
We will go now, to be able to take back Konya

565
01:00:40,880 --> 01:00:43,879
Celali, protect the Sultan.

566
01:00:52,400 --> 01:00:55,479
-Osman, they're escaping!
-Let them go.

567
01:00:55,600 --> 01:00:59,319
Their time has come,
Mesut has the throne now.

568
01:01:42,120 --> 01:01:43,479
My Cicek Hatun?

569
01:01:45,360 --> 01:01:47,999
Why are you staring all innocent?

570
01:01:51,640 --> 01:01:52,919
I'm good.

571
01:01:54,360 --> 01:01:55,959
I'm very good.

572
01:02:04,800 --> 01:02:07,399
What will I do without my mother, Aktemur?

573
01:02:09,000 --> 01:02:12,559
My father left, my sister Esra left.

574
01:02:13,720 --> 01:02:15,759
Now my mother goes.

575
01:02:18,560 --> 01:02:20,159
My Cicek.

576
01:02:23,320 --> 01:02:24,719
I'm here.

577
01:02:25,200 --> 01:02:27,679
I will not go anywhere, always by your side.

578
01:02:29,080 --> 01:02:31,839
Two years pass by quickly.

579
01:02:32,080 --> 01:02:34,199
It's not like she cannot come back.

580
01:02:34,680 --> 01:02:37,239
This separation will end one day.

581
01:02:39,240 --> 01:02:41,159
Aktemur, promise me.

582
01:02:42,240 --> 01:02:44,279
Promise me to not leave me.

583
01:02:46,120 --> 01:02:48,359
How can I leave you, my Hatun.

584
01:02:50,200 --> 01:02:51,479
I promise.

585
01:02:53,920 --> 01:02:55,959
Aktemur's promise.

586
01:02:59,240 --> 01:03:00,839
Are we allowed in, Bey?

587
01:03:02,240 --> 01:03:04,039
Come, Kutlu.

588
01:03:10,480 --> 01:03:13,159
Bey, Bengi Hatun is here.

589
01:03:16,120 --> 01:03:17,959
My mother is here, Aktemur.

590
01:03:21,760 --> 01:03:23,359
Thank you.

591
01:03:24,080 --> 01:03:26,559
You go quickly to follow Osman Bey's order.

592
01:03:26,760 --> 01:03:28,439
As you command, Bey.

593
01:03:32,120 --> 01:03:33,479
Let's go.

594
01:03:34,920 --> 01:03:36,039
Welcome, Bengi Hatun.

595
01:03:36,080 --> 01:03:38,439
-Welcome.
-Mother!

596
01:03:42,280 --> 01:03:43,319
Welcome.

597
01:03:51,840 --> 01:03:54,999
I hope it will be a short separation,
Mother Bengi

598
01:04:05,520 --> 01:04:06,999
Aybars?

599
01:04:08,200 --> 01:04:10,439
-What's this?
-I don't know my Bey.

600
01:04:26,240 --> 01:04:27,559
Take a look.

601
01:04:34,200 --> 01:04:35,919
Careful!

602
01:04:45,200 --> 01:04:48,159
We will make Turks experience hell.

603
01:05:03,360 --> 01:05:05,359
Hold the gates!

604
01:05:06,720 --> 01:05:08,679
Attack!

605
01:05:10,800 --> 01:05:13,799
Alcicek, gather the women and children at the back.

606
01:05:13,960 --> 01:05:15,679
Protect them, come on!

607
01:05:15,720 --> 01:05:18,519
-Come on, this way!
-Give me a sword, come on!

608
01:05:37,280 --> 01:05:39,359
We will show no mercy today!

609
01:05:39,600 --> 01:05:42,119
We will not spare them!

610
01:06:50,080 --> 01:06:52,959
Gazan Khan wants you to sit on the throne.

611
01:07:16,400 --> 01:07:18,199
Thank you Osman Bey.

612
01:07:18,440 --> 01:07:20,839
Thank you too, mighty Sultan.

613
01:07:22,240 --> 01:07:25,319
Esrigun Hatun, you came right on time.

614
01:07:25,680 --> 01:07:26,999
Thank you.

615
01:07:28,640 --> 01:07:33,359
You have been fighting alone against the traitor
who rebelled against us, Osman Bey.

616
01:07:34,200 --> 01:07:35,599
We are actually late.

617
01:07:39,080 --> 01:07:40,199
Now...

618
01:07:41,040 --> 01:07:44,399
...we will talk in private with Osman Bey.

619
01:07:58,000 --> 01:07:59,599
Osman Bey.

620
01:08:00,160 --> 01:08:01,999
Come with me.

621
01:08:10,680 --> 01:08:15,319
We sat on this throne thanks to Gazan Khan.

622
01:08:18,560 --> 01:08:20,799
This throne is useless now.

623
01:08:23,040 --> 01:08:25,037
The one that gives meaning to a throne

624
01:08:25,520 --> 01:08:27,519
is the one who takes it.

625
01:08:27,920 --> 01:08:29,879
Mighty Sultan,

626
01:08:30,120 --> 01:08:33,037
we know very well how well-intended you are.

627
01:08:34,680 --> 01:08:36,439
It does not matter.

628
01:08:36,960 --> 01:08:42,078
Both throne and the one who sits on it are useless.

629
01:08:46,840 --> 01:08:49,679
What are you trying to say, my Sultan?

630
01:08:50,240 --> 01:08:53,839
The one who stays in the shadow cannot blossom, Osman Bey.

631
01:08:54,040 --> 01:08:56,719
No matter how hard I try, it won't.

632
01:08:58,279 --> 01:09:01,238
Konya will die under the shadow of Mongols.

633
01:09:03,600 --> 01:09:05,078
The old tree...

634
01:09:05,960 --> 01:09:07,799
...must break its dry branch...

635
01:09:08,040 --> 01:09:10,358
...so that the sprout can see the sun.

636
01:09:12,040 --> 01:09:13,759
We are from the same root.

637
01:09:14,279 --> 01:09:17,037
We want to grow and blossom.

638
01:09:17,319 --> 01:09:18,919
Osman Bey,

639
01:09:19,160 --> 01:09:22,479
From now on, Konya will struggle
for you to see the sun.

640
01:09:29,000 --> 01:09:32,078
-Mighty Sultan...
-This is the truth, Osman Bey.

641
01:09:33,920 --> 01:09:37,559
The soldiers, catapults and all the guns

642
01:09:37,960 --> 01:09:41,879
that I promised to you will
set out as soon as possible.

643
01:09:43,479 --> 01:09:45,919
Konya does not need this power anymore.

644
01:09:46,359 --> 01:09:48,959
And it has no power to use them.

645
01:09:55,280 --> 01:09:57,719
Will you hand over the banner to me?

646
01:09:59,560 --> 01:10:03,199
You have been holding the banner
for a long time Osman Bey.

647
01:10:03,880 --> 01:10:05,959
The eyes hardly see it.

648
01:10:06,280 --> 01:10:10,399
The tongue hardly speak it and
the heart hardly believe it.

649
01:10:19,320 --> 01:10:21,159
Mighty Sultan.

650
01:10:23,000 --> 01:10:27,119
I swear that I will make Turks free.

651
01:10:28,840 --> 01:10:33,039
I will raise generations that will make
Turks rule the world.

652
01:10:33,200 --> 01:10:34,679
I swear that

653
01:10:35,120 --> 01:10:38,519
I will plant our banner to the highest
place of this world.

654
01:10:40,480 --> 01:10:43,399
Your oath is my oath, Osman Bey.

655
01:10:44,160 --> 01:10:46,199
Have a safe journey.

656
01:10:48,920 --> 01:10:50,319
My Sultan.

657
01:10:54,200 --> 01:10:56,719
The path of the The Red Apple
is always open.

658
01:10:59,960 --> 01:11:02,679
- May you live long.
- Thank you.

659
01:12:37,440 --> 01:12:39,399
Stop!

660
01:12:50,520 --> 01:12:52,919
This is the end for you.

661
01:12:54,640 --> 01:12:57,079
Byzantine is Great.

662
01:12:57,400 --> 01:13:00,759
You are just shepherds.

663
01:13:00,960 --> 01:13:04,239
You can't get away with this.

664
01:13:04,280 --> 01:13:07,039
You will pay for this!

665
01:13:15,080 --> 01:13:16,399
Alcicek!

666
01:13:16,520 --> 01:13:18,799
-Mother! Mother!
-Alcicek!

667
01:13:22,880 --> 01:13:24,759
Mother!

668
01:13:25,080 --> 01:13:26,879
Alcicek..

669
01:13:32,640 --> 01:13:35,639
Mother! Let go of me!

670
01:13:38,200 --> 01:13:40,599
Aktemur!

671
01:13:41,040 --> 01:13:44,759
This is the fate of people who stands against us!

672
01:13:44,920 --> 01:13:47,159
Aktemur! Leave me!

673
01:13:47,840 --> 01:13:51,719
You should feel lucky that you're
one of the first to die.

674
01:13:51,880 --> 01:13:53,399
Leave me!

675
01:13:53,960 --> 01:13:55,999
Aktemur!

676
01:13:56,920 --> 01:14:01,359
Aktemur!

677
01:14:04,880 --> 01:14:08,079
Aktemur! Aktemur!

678
01:14:08,160 --> 01:14:10,639
Leave me! Aktemur!

679
01:14:10,800 --> 01:14:13,359
Aktemur! Aktemur!

680
01:14:13,600 --> 01:14:15,119
Leave me!

681
01:14:15,160 --> 01:14:16,999
Put them all in the tent!

682
01:14:17,040 --> 01:14:18,279
Aktemur!

683
01:14:18,280 --> 01:14:20,719
-Burn them alive!
-Alcicek...

684
01:14:21,440 --> 01:14:23,959
Aktemur!

685
01:14:24,160 --> 01:14:26,239
-Aktemur!
-Shut up.

686
01:14:31,080 --> 01:14:32,439
Aktemur!

687
01:14:32,840 --> 01:14:35,879
-Both you and your mother are dead.
-Aktemur!

688
01:14:37,120 --> 01:14:39,039
Divine justice.

689
01:14:42,720 --> 01:14:44,199
Leave me!

690
01:14:52,120 --> 01:14:55,479
No mercy today!

691
01:14:56,040 --> 01:14:59,399
No forgiveness today!

692
01:16:19,840 --> 01:16:27,679
ForumKayi.com

693
01:16:44,080 --> 01:16:46,479
Help! Help!

694
01:16:46,480 --> 01:16:48,199
Calm down. I'll save you.

695
01:16:49,000 --> 01:16:51,079
We will be alright.

696
01:16:51,160 --> 01:16:53,119
Help!

697
01:16:55,160 --> 01:16:56,999
Help!

698
01:16:57,360 --> 01:17:00,599
Save us! Help!

699
01:17:02,800 --> 01:17:06,559
Come here! Don't get close to the fire.

700
01:17:24,920 --> 01:17:26,239
Aktemur.

701
01:17:59,240 --> 01:18:00,919
Help!

702
01:18:01,560 --> 01:18:03,279
Alright, kids. We'll be alright.

703
01:18:03,360 --> 01:18:04,759
Calm down.

704
01:18:04,920 --> 01:18:08,279
-Help!
-Help us, my Allah.

705
01:18:08,680 --> 01:18:11,039
Save us, my Allah.

706
01:18:32,960 --> 01:18:34,999
Aktemu

707
01:18:36,680 --> 01:18:40,359
Aktemur!

708
01:18:40,560 --> 01:18:42,519
Mother!

709
01:18:49,280 --> 01:18:50,719
Aktemur!

710
01:18:50,880 --> 01:18:53,079
Aktemur! Aktemur!

711
01:18:53,200 --> 01:18:55,679
-Aktemur!
-Mother...

712
01:18:57,760 --> 01:19:00,599
Alcicek... Kids.

713
01:19:00,960 --> 01:19:04,359
-Help! Help!
-Help us!

714
01:19:08,600 --> 01:19:09,959
Aktemur.

715
01:19:10,040 --> 01:19:11,839
Alright.

716
01:19:13,040 --> 01:19:14,559
Aktemur?

717
01:19:14,600 --> 01:19:15,959
Aktemur, wake up!

718
01:19:21,760 --> 01:19:23,919
Aktemur, wake up! Open your eyes!

719
01:19:42,520 --> 01:19:44,919
Alps, come on

720
01:19:46,160 --> 01:19:48,319
Help the injured!

721
01:19:50,240 --> 01:19:52,319
Aktemur! Aktemur!

722
01:19:52,600 --> 01:19:54,279
-Aktemur!
-Malhun.

723
01:19:54,440 --> 01:19:56,759
Malhun, Alcicek is burning!

724
01:19:56,800 --> 01:19:58,759
Save her! She's burning!

725
01:19:58,760 --> 01:20:00,959
-Save Alcicek!
-Where is she?

726
01:20:00,960 --> 01:20:03,319
There! Come on! Save Alcicek!

727
01:20:03,360 --> 01:20:05,959
Come on! Go, hurry up!

728
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:08,759
Alps, put out the fire!

729
01:20:08,960 --> 01:20:11,399
Put it out! Alcicek!

730
01:20:11,440 --> 01:20:13,959
Alcicek, hold on! Alps!

731
01:20:14,000 --> 01:20:15,959
Alps, put it out!

732
01:20:16,120 --> 01:20:18,919
Bring water! Alcicek!

733
01:20:24,680 --> 01:20:27,479
Come on, put it out! Come on!

734
01:20:27,600 --> 01:20:29,719
Come on! Alcicek!

735
01:20:30,200 --> 01:20:32,799
-Put it out!
-Come on, faster!

736
01:20:33,680 --> 01:20:35,279
Oh my dear..

737
01:20:35,480 --> 01:20:37,479
Aktemur!

738
01:20:37,960 --> 01:20:39,719
-Calm down.
-Aktemur...

739
01:20:44,760 --> 01:20:47,439
Is he dead? Is he dead?

740
01:20:47,680 --> 01:20:48,999
Is he dead?

741
01:20:52,480 --> 01:20:55,359
Is my son dead? Tell me the truth.

742
01:20:55,680 --> 01:20:56,999
He's dead.

743
01:20:57,600 --> 01:21:01,879
Aktemur! Don't leave me. Aktemur!

744
01:21:02,840 --> 01:21:04,959
Aktemur! Stay here.

745
01:21:06,400 --> 01:21:10,799
Aktemur, stand up! Come on!

746
01:21:11,480 --> 01:21:14,759
Aktemur! Aktemur, stand up!

747
01:21:19,600 --> 01:21:23,119
Put it out, come on.

748
01:21:30,560 --> 01:21:32,719
There are kids. Kids!

749
01:21:33,560 --> 01:21:35,239
Come on, kids.

750
01:21:37,560 --> 01:21:39,879
Take the kids away!

751
01:21:41,280 --> 01:21:42,519
Come on.

752
01:21:42,600 --> 01:21:44,919
Alcicek? Alcicek.

753
01:21:45,120 --> 01:21:46,959
Alcicek, come on.

754
01:21:47,080 --> 01:21:49,719
Aktemur... Aktemur!

755
01:21:51,960 --> 01:21:54,039
-Alcicek.
-Aktemur!

756
01:21:54,160 --> 01:21:58,879
Aktemur... Aktemur! Aktemur!

757
01:22:00,400 --> 01:22:02,079
Aktemur!

758
01:22:03,000 --> 01:22:05,239
Aktemur!

759
01:22:06,400 --> 01:22:07,479
My dear.

760
01:22:07,680 --> 01:22:09,359
Ayse, alright. Calm down.

761
01:22:09,360 --> 01:22:13,799
-Malhun, my son is dead.
-He'll survive.

762
01:22:14,240 --> 01:22:17,199
Alps, bring the stretcher!

763
01:22:18,000 --> 01:22:19,999
Ayse, Ayse.

764
01:22:20,280 --> 01:22:22,239
-Come on!
-He's breathing.

765
01:22:22,240 --> 01:22:24,159
-Yes.
-He's breathing!

766
01:22:24,160 --> 01:22:26,399
-He's breathing!
-Come on!

767
01:22:26,440 --> 01:22:28,199
Come on, alps!

768
01:22:28,320 --> 01:22:30,359
Carry Aktemur inside! Come on!

769
01:22:30,400 --> 01:22:33,199
-Carry him inside!
-Hold him.

770
01:22:34,120 --> 01:22:37,279
-Come on, take him.
-Alps!

771
01:22:37,720 --> 01:22:39,999
Come on.

772
01:22:47,360 --> 01:22:51,159
If Allah permits, we'll have arrived in Yenisehir
before dark.

773
01:22:51,440 --> 01:22:53,719
And Sultan Mesud's aids..

774
01:22:53,920 --> 01:22:56,279
...will come after us, I hope.

775
01:22:56,760 --> 01:23:00,639
When Sultan Mesud ascended
the throne we both got what we wanted...

776
01:23:00,680 --> 01:23:04,119
...and saved Konya from the clutches of traitors, my Bey.

777
01:23:04,960 --> 01:23:06,719
Yes, Bala.

778
01:23:09,840 --> 01:23:12,799
But you still have some doubt.

779
01:23:13,640 --> 01:23:17,199
Yes. Ismihan's escape, my Bey.

780
01:23:18,400 --> 01:23:21,479
I won't feel at ease before I see her caught.

781
01:23:22,200 --> 01:23:23,519
You're right.

782
01:23:23,760 --> 01:23:27,119
But she has nowhere to go.
This is the end for her.

783
01:23:29,080 --> 01:23:30,759
Yet..

784
01:23:31,440 --> 01:23:33,399
What makes me worried is..

785
01:23:33,680 --> 01:23:38,839
...what the Lord of Bursa did while
we were fighting in Konya.

786
01:23:40,640 --> 01:23:43,119
He sees us as enemies, after all.

787
01:23:43,680 --> 01:23:45,719
He'll make a move.

788
01:23:51,880 --> 01:23:54,119
My Bey! My Bey!

789
01:23:55,080 --> 01:23:56,759
My Bey!

790
01:23:57,800 --> 01:23:59,479
Kargin Tribe...

791
01:23:59,600 --> 01:24:03,399
Lord Valens attacked Kargin Tribe
and the other tribes.

792
01:24:07,840 --> 01:24:09,919
What are you saying?

793
01:24:14,400 --> 01:24:15,799
What's the situation?

794
01:24:15,920 --> 01:24:17,919
It's not good at all, my Bey.

795
01:24:23,400 --> 01:24:26,639
Mother Sultan will flee to the enemy's land now.

796
01:24:28,480 --> 01:24:30,399
Send alps all around.

797
01:24:30,600 --> 01:24:32,759
We're going to Kargin Tribe.

798
01:24:33,200 --> 01:24:34,599
Come on, alps!

799
01:24:57,440 --> 01:25:00,279
Where are the scouts, Faustus?

800
01:25:02,160 --> 01:25:04,679
They'll be here shortly, sir.

801
01:25:05,000 --> 01:25:10,719
I can't let Konya gain power
with barbarians again.

802
01:25:13,040 --> 01:25:14,999
The fate of these lands..

803
01:25:15,200 --> 01:25:19,999
...will be determined by Christ's
loyal servants.

804
01:25:21,240 --> 01:25:24,959
What will we do, sir?
Attack Konya?

805
01:25:41,560 --> 01:25:45,199
I'll stick to my
alliance with Konya.

806
01:25:47,640 --> 01:25:50,279
Whoever stands against us...

807
01:25:52,920 --> 01:25:55,759
...is doomed to be destroyed, Leo.

808
01:25:57,600 --> 01:25:59,519
But,

809
01:26:00,000 --> 01:26:03,439
first we need to find out
what's happening in Konya.

810
01:26:04,760 --> 01:26:07,279
Where are the scouts, Faustus?

811
01:26:08,520 --> 01:26:09,599
Sir.

812
01:26:24,720 --> 01:26:26,239
Lord Valens.

813
01:26:26,680 --> 01:26:32,079
As Osman Bey and others were getting executed,
the Mongolian Princess stopped the execution.

814
01:26:32,160 --> 01:26:36,559
Sir, they put Mesut on the throne
with the order of Gazan Khan.

815
01:26:50,880 --> 01:26:53,479
I swear by Jesus that

816
01:26:54,160 --> 01:26:56,039
I'll exterminate them.

817
01:27:01,720 --> 01:27:03,719
What about Nayman?

818
01:27:04,360 --> 01:27:05,679
Where is he?

819
01:27:05,960 --> 01:27:10,839
They drew back to the Frontiers with
Mother Sultan and Sultan Alaeddin, sir.

820
01:27:14,680 --> 01:27:18,319
Nayman withdrew, so are we going to
oppose Gazan Khan, sir?

821
01:27:20,640 --> 01:27:22,919
-Faustus.
-Yes sir.

822
01:27:24,760 --> 01:27:28,079
Go to the Frontiers
and find Nayman.

823
01:27:28,320 --> 01:27:29,519
Right away sir.

824
01:27:30,080 --> 01:27:33,239
Leo, get the soldiers ready.

825
01:27:33,920 --> 01:27:36,119
We will go to Konya.

826
01:27:57,080 --> 01:27:58,479
Ya Shafi (The Curer).

827
01:27:59,480 --> 01:28:00,919
Ya Shafi (The Curer).

828
01:28:15,800 --> 01:28:19,359
He will be all right, right mother?
He will be all right?

829
01:28:20,160 --> 01:28:22,319
His wound is so deep, girl.

830
01:28:22,680 --> 01:28:24,519
He has lost a lot of blood.

831
01:28:26,720 --> 01:28:29,679
But my son is strong.

832
01:28:31,760 --> 01:28:36,559
He will get up, right, Kumral Abdal?

833
01:28:37,160 --> 01:28:38,679
If Allah permits.

834
01:28:39,200 --> 01:28:40,319
If Allah permits.

835
01:28:43,960 --> 01:28:45,799
Hatuns.

836
01:28:45,800 --> 01:28:49,519
You also have a lot of injuries,
come here and let us take a look.

837
01:28:51,200 --> 01:28:53,399
I'm all right, I don't want it.

838
01:28:53,760 --> 01:28:56,159
You cannot help anyone in this condition.

839
01:28:56,320 --> 01:28:58,119
There are injuries all around.

840
01:28:58,440 --> 01:29:01,439
Bengi, Ayes, pull yourself together.

841
01:29:03,760 --> 01:29:04,999
Mother.

842
01:29:06,240 --> 01:29:07,959
We have put out the fire.

843
01:29:08,240 --> 01:29:10,639
Healers are dealing with the injured ones.

844
01:29:11,840 --> 01:29:14,039
Martyrs are ready to be buried.

845
01:29:14,480 --> 01:29:15,919
All right my children.

846
01:29:18,880 --> 01:29:20,279
I died.

847
01:29:21,320 --> 01:29:23,039
I couldn't protect him.

848
01:29:25,840 --> 01:29:27,839
I couldn't protect my trust.

849
01:29:29,280 --> 01:29:32,239
I lost my Oktem
I lost my tribe.

850
01:29:39,120 --> 01:29:41,039
I'm dead now.

851
01:29:41,920 --> 01:29:43,919
You promised me.

852
01:29:44,360 --> 01:29:46,879
You told me that you wouldn't leave me alone.

853
01:29:50,040 --> 01:29:51,639
Come on, hang on!

854
01:29:57,320 --> 01:29:59,319
It's all my fault.

855
01:30:01,280 --> 01:30:03,559
My children are paying

856
01:30:04,880 --> 01:30:06,959
for my sins.

857
01:30:16,360 --> 01:30:19,759
Ulgen, bring me water with
vinegar right away!

858
01:30:21,320 --> 01:30:22,879
Quickly!

859
01:30:27,400 --> 01:30:28,679
He's burning.

860
01:30:46,160 --> 01:30:49,159
Nayman's Base

861
01:30:49,280 --> 01:30:52,359
Osman's plan annulled the seal, Nayman.

862
01:30:52,960 --> 01:30:54,559
Did you trust this one?

863
01:30:54,840 --> 01:30:59,279
You are the Sultan of Konya, Alaeddin.

864
01:31:02,080 --> 01:31:03,439
Sultan.

865
01:31:05,280 --> 01:31:08,199
The fact that Gazan overshadowed your reputation

866
01:31:08,680 --> 01:31:10,719
is no one's business.

867
01:31:20,800 --> 01:31:23,879
It is time to think in silent.

868
01:31:26,360 --> 01:31:27,799
Osman...

869
01:31:29,120 --> 01:31:30,999
Gazan Khan and Beys...

870
01:31:31,400 --> 01:31:33,239
...are with Mesut.

871
01:31:33,840 --> 01:31:36,559
We need a great power
that will break this down.

872
01:31:39,280 --> 01:31:41,879
Great Lord of Byzantium.

873
01:31:42,360 --> 01:31:45,279
Valens is our ally.

874
01:31:50,520 --> 01:31:53,199
He has a strong army behind him.

875
01:32:03,000 --> 01:32:07,279
Great Nayman, Lord Valens
attacked Turkmen tribes.

876
01:32:10,200 --> 01:32:13,079
Kargin tribe was among them.

877
01:32:22,800 --> 01:32:25,679
Our enemy and our hostility is the same.

878
01:32:27,960 --> 01:32:29,839
It is my turn, Nayman.

879
01:32:33,560 --> 01:32:35,319
I will use the power of Sultan.

880
01:32:36,360 --> 01:32:39,639
I will gather brave warriors
who seek revenge

881
01:32:40,360 --> 01:32:42,079
behind me.

882
01:32:42,840 --> 01:32:44,039
How?

883
01:32:47,080 --> 01:32:49,159
I'll leave with my son now.

884
01:32:51,480 --> 01:32:52,679
Soon,

885
01:32:53,880 --> 01:32:57,319
I will come back with
blood-thirsty soldiers.

886
01:33:27,920 --> 01:33:30,119
It says 400 swords here

887
01:33:30,520 --> 01:33:33,319
I promised 1000 swords to Osman Bey.

888
01:33:36,520 --> 01:33:40,799
Do you want them to say Sultan is
on the throne but he cannot keep his promise?

889
01:33:41,040 --> 01:33:42,359
Get out!

890
01:33:48,320 --> 01:33:51,279
It is important than ever before.

891
01:33:53,840 --> 01:33:58,279
Melt all the irons and helmets of the soldiers...

892
01:33:58,680 --> 01:34:02,079
...then complete the missing swords
and send them away.

893
01:34:02,640 --> 01:34:04,559
Yes my Sultan.

894
01:34:05,200 --> 01:34:07,399
What about the troops that will leave?

895
01:34:07,480 --> 01:34:10,479
-They are getting ready, my Sultan.
-May I come in, my Sultan?

896
01:34:10,520 --> 01:34:11,639
Come in.

897
01:34:17,280 --> 01:34:20,919
Mighty Sultan, Valens the Lord of Bursa
wants to see you.

898
01:34:27,440 --> 01:34:30,439
Make preparations. Leave now.

899
01:34:42,080 --> 01:34:44,279
Politics is retaliation.

900
01:34:44,640 --> 01:34:46,079
Now

901
01:34:46,800 --> 01:34:50,759
Gather all the beggars in Konya
and bring them here.

902
01:34:51,880 --> 01:34:54,079
Let's see if they need anything.

903
01:34:55,120 --> 01:34:57,439
Lord of Bursa, sir...

904
01:35:00,160 --> 01:35:03,559
Let the Lord of Bursa wait for a while, helper.

905
01:35:21,720 --> 01:35:24,919
The Beys of tribes around
are coming as you ordered, mother.

906
01:35:25,120 --> 01:35:28,079
We received news from Kopruhisar,
Bilecik and Inegol.

907
01:35:28,280 --> 01:35:29,799
They all took precautions.

908
01:35:29,800 --> 01:35:31,359
What about Yenisehir?

909
01:35:31,440 --> 01:35:33,039
How are things in Yenisehir?

910
01:35:33,120 --> 01:35:37,759
Measures have been increased.
We also placed patrol Alps around tribes.

911
01:36:15,120 --> 01:36:17,039
My Allah, help us.

912
01:36:40,400 --> 01:36:41,879
Stop..

913
01:36:43,520 --> 01:36:45,119
You'll be alright.

914
01:36:47,840 --> 01:36:48,759
My son..

915
01:36:54,280 --> 01:36:56,159
Osman Bey, help us.

916
01:36:56,600 --> 01:36:57,639
I will.

917
01:36:58,000 --> 01:37:00,239
I will, I will. Don't worry.

918
01:37:00,680 --> 01:37:03,239
Alps! Help everyone!

919
01:37:07,920 --> 01:37:08,759
Are you alright?

920
01:37:08,840 --> 01:37:11,079
-I am... I am...
-You'll be alright.

921
01:37:11,360 --> 01:37:12,999
Aykurt, give her water!

922
01:37:15,880 --> 01:37:17,079
Drink it.

923
01:37:21,360 --> 01:37:23,759
Come here... You are alright, right?

924
01:37:23,920 --> 01:37:25,599
I am alright. I am alright.

925
01:37:30,880 --> 01:37:32,319
Dastards..

926
01:37:32,800 --> 01:37:34,639
Look what they did to this tribe.

927
01:37:34,880 --> 01:37:38,439
Don't worry, brother.
We'll make them pay for it, for sure.

928
01:37:40,960 --> 01:37:43,079
Look at what they did to this tribe.

929
01:37:46,160 --> 01:37:47,959
Look at what they did.

930
01:37:48,440 --> 01:37:50,639
Look at those tents.

931
01:37:53,560 --> 01:37:55,359
Dastards.

932
01:37:57,520 --> 01:37:59,719
They did not attack walls or castles...

933
01:38:00,080 --> 01:38:03,319
...they attacked the tribe,
which was easier for them to attack.

934
01:38:04,320 --> 01:38:06,759
I swear, I will drown you in your blood.

935
01:38:35,680 --> 01:38:37,399
My children..

936
01:38:39,360 --> 01:38:41,159
My innocent children..

937
01:38:44,120 --> 01:38:45,879
My innocent people...

938
01:39:01,880 --> 01:39:03,399
Lord Valens.

939
01:39:04,440 --> 01:39:06,959
You will heavily pay for this.

940
01:39:25,400 --> 01:39:26,639
Cerkutay!

941
01:39:27,120 --> 01:39:28,519
-Boran!
-My Bey.

942
01:39:28,840 --> 01:39:30,159
Take Alps out!

943
01:39:30,560 --> 01:39:32,759
You will meet people's needs.

944
01:39:32,920 --> 01:39:34,719
You will treat everyone here!

945
01:39:35,640 --> 01:39:38,399
-Yes my Bey.
-Yes my Bey.

946
01:40:40,440 --> 01:40:43,319
Those Turks never forget anything.

947
01:40:44,240 --> 01:40:46,159
They are also easily offended.

948
01:40:46,840 --> 01:40:50,519
It's too weak for them to think
that your willpower can be broken...

949
01:40:50,720 --> 01:40:52,279
...in this way, sir.

950
01:40:53,080 --> 01:40:54,799
Let them get revenge.

951
01:40:56,000 --> 01:40:58,559
When I really step on the battlefield...

952
01:40:59,480 --> 01:41:01,599
...they will not have a palace to go.

953
01:41:09,360 --> 01:41:11,119
Those people are blood thirsty.

954
01:41:12,360 --> 01:41:14,079
They went back...

955
01:41:14,880 --> 01:41:16,079
..but they won't stop.

956
01:41:21,200 --> 01:41:23,159
But we will not stop as well.

957
01:41:25,360 --> 01:41:26,439
We will not.

958
01:41:30,480 --> 01:41:32,239
My children! -Osman.

959
01:41:33,800 --> 01:41:35,559
Are you alright?

960
01:41:36,880 --> 01:41:39,239
-Malhun.
-Osman.

961
01:41:44,000 --> 01:41:45,839
We are alright, but...

962
01:41:54,600 --> 01:41:57,199
-Are you alright?
-I am not.

963
01:42:09,280 --> 01:42:10,759
Aktemur?

964
01:42:13,880 --> 01:42:15,479
Alcicek?

965
01:42:28,920 --> 01:42:31,159
Kumral Abdal, tell me.
What happened?

966
01:42:32,680 --> 01:42:35,799
With Allah's consent,
he will heal and stand up, my Bey.

967
01:42:39,960 --> 01:42:41,679
I hope he will.

968
01:42:48,440 --> 01:42:50,159
Let me check them.

969
01:42:51,120 --> 01:42:54,359
Thanks to Allah.
Thanks to Allah.

970
01:43:00,200 --> 01:43:01,919
Aktemur..

971
01:43:05,200 --> 01:43:06,919
Alcicek...

972
01:43:10,240 --> 01:43:12,319
-Uncle.
-My son.

973
01:43:12,760 --> 01:43:14,279
-Are you alright?
-Uncle...

974
01:43:16,360 --> 01:43:18,919
I could not protect the entrustment, uncle.

975
01:43:21,760 --> 01:43:23,279
They killed.

976
01:43:25,160 --> 01:43:27,119
They killed people in front of me.

977
01:43:32,320 --> 01:43:35,239
-I could not even die.
-My son...

978
01:43:36,800 --> 01:43:38,399
How can you say that?

979
01:43:38,920 --> 01:43:40,479
Does that suit a Bey?

980
01:43:40,920 --> 01:43:42,959
You will be stronger than before.

981
01:43:48,400 --> 01:43:50,679
So that they tried to kill us...

982
01:43:53,640 --> 01:43:55,679
...now it is time to take their lives.

983
01:44:08,160 --> 01:44:09,479
Turahan!

984
01:44:10,280 --> 01:44:11,319
My Bey.

985
01:44:12,200 --> 01:44:14,079
Call the Beys.

986
01:44:14,840 --> 01:44:17,959
-I will gather the council.
-Yes my Bey.

987
01:44:27,520 --> 01:44:29,119
Hadhrat Sultan..

988
01:44:29,480 --> 01:44:32,839
Seeing you on the throne again
is such a big pleasure.

989
01:44:33,040 --> 01:44:34,519
Congrats.

990
01:44:35,680 --> 01:44:38,359
I appreciate, Lord Valens.

991
01:44:41,600 --> 01:44:43,919
At the same time, I am mad.

992
01:44:46,640 --> 01:44:50,239
I guess you are mad because
what happened on the frontiers.

993
01:44:51,400 --> 01:44:54,359
You grieved the tribes of Turkmens.

994
01:44:54,720 --> 01:44:57,079
And you are here, congratulating me.

995
01:44:58,280 --> 01:45:01,119
Do not mistake me for someone else, Lord.

996
01:45:03,360 --> 01:45:07,239
There is a difference between
the tribes and the Hadhrat Sultan.

997
01:45:08,160 --> 01:45:10,839
This is one of the reasons of my visit.

998
01:45:15,240 --> 01:45:17,279
Osman Bey is my enemy.

999
01:45:17,840 --> 01:45:19,439
And I will kill him.

1000
01:45:19,720 --> 01:45:23,799
I want you to stop supporting him with your soldiers.

1001
01:45:25,640 --> 01:45:29,839
On those bloody lands,
one cannot get everything he wants...

1002
01:45:30,120 --> 01:45:31,959
..Lord Valens.

1003
01:45:37,240 --> 01:45:41,599
You are Gaznan Khan's..
-Adopted daughter.

1004
01:45:49,960 --> 01:45:51,639
If you allow me...

1005
01:45:52,480 --> 01:45:56,159
...I want to finish what I was saying to the Sultan.

1006
01:46:02,840 --> 01:46:04,879
Your Sultanate is quite new.

1007
01:46:07,480 --> 01:46:10,399
And Konya is fighting with poverty.

1008
01:46:14,480 --> 01:46:17,199
If Esrigun Hatun allows..

1009
01:46:18,480 --> 01:46:22,159
...Bursa wants to send
a large amount of supplies to Konya.

1010
01:46:23,680 --> 01:46:26,359
And the only thing necessary for that is...

1011
01:46:27,320 --> 01:46:30,599
...the preparation of the meeting
between me and Osman Bey.

1012
01:46:30,960 --> 01:46:33,199
Hadhrat Sultan.

1013
01:46:42,160 --> 01:46:44,399
Konya is dealing with poverty...

1014
01:46:45,280 --> 01:46:47,999
...and Osman Bey is dealing with you.

1015
01:47:02,400 --> 01:47:03,759
Lord.

1016
01:47:06,520 --> 01:47:08,959
We all want peace.

1017
01:47:13,680 --> 01:47:15,719
I will do the necessary thing.

1018
01:47:34,800 --> 01:47:36,679
He will arrange the meeting.

1019
01:47:37,680 --> 01:47:40,639
-Could you learn?
-I did, sir.

1020
01:47:41,280 --> 01:47:45,079
The army that is getting ready, the weapons, the catapults...

1021
01:47:46,240 --> 01:47:48,119
...those are all being sent to Osman.

1022
01:47:48,320 --> 01:47:51,359
What a shame...
He won't be able to send them.

1023
01:47:51,640 --> 01:47:53,399
Inform Nayman now.

1024
01:47:55,280 --> 01:47:59,079
Was that the Lord who allied with Nayman?

1025
01:48:01,640 --> 01:48:03,399
He was.

1026
01:48:16,520 --> 01:48:18,959
So snake Ismihan escaped again, huh?

1027
01:48:19,840 --> 01:48:21,879
She did. She escaped.

1028
01:48:22,360 --> 01:48:24,399
But she will not get away with this.

1029
01:48:26,880 --> 01:48:30,719
Thank Allah.
Ismihan left, the test is over, huh?

1030
01:48:32,280 --> 01:48:35,479
They always leave, my Ulgen.
But we are always being tested.

1031
01:48:36,640 --> 01:48:39,959
Turks are always being tested!

1032
01:48:41,120 --> 01:48:43,059
We still have that Lord!

1033
01:48:43,059 --> 01:48:46,499
We still have that Nayman or
whatever his name is!

1034
01:48:47,120 --> 01:48:50,839
I don't know what I am saying...

1035
01:48:52,200 --> 01:48:54,479
The souls of those who harm children...

1036
01:48:56,560 --> 01:48:58,239
...are dead inside!
Dead!

1037
01:49:00,800 --> 01:49:04,279
They will be their turn as well. Don't worry.

1038
01:49:06,920 --> 01:49:11,439
We won't stop until we take the lives of
those who hurt the poor.

1039
01:49:19,800 --> 01:49:22,079
Oh child, come..

1040
01:49:23,240 --> 01:49:25,839
Let me take you to your mother.

1041
01:49:41,520 --> 01:49:44,079
Malhun Hatun, are you alright?

1042
01:49:44,920 --> 01:49:47,959
Dark Midwife, my pain doesn't go away.

1043
01:49:50,720 --> 01:49:53,919
You didn't rest today.
May Allah protect you.

1044
01:49:54,880 --> 01:49:57,359
Look, you haven't done anything wrong,
did you?

1045
01:50:29,720 --> 01:50:32,759
When we were saying Sultan Mesut
sat on Konya throne..

1046
01:50:33,560 --> 01:50:35,719
And good news awaits us..

1047
01:50:36,920 --> 01:50:39,719
Bad news were awaiting us at tribe.

1048
01:50:43,120 --> 01:50:45,079
Don't worry though.

1049
01:50:47,600 --> 01:50:49,519
e will deal with them all.

1050
01:50:50,280 --> 01:50:52,479
Strengthen the flame in you.

1051
01:50:55,040 --> 01:50:59,079
When the aid from Sultan Mesut
comes to these lands..

1052
01:51:01,040 --> 01:51:03,399
We will make them pay.

1053
01:51:03,680 --> 01:51:05,439
If Allah permits, my Bey.

1054
01:51:07,320 --> 01:51:08,359
My Bey.

1055
01:51:09,840 --> 01:51:13,319
Even if the support arrives,
what can we do against Bursa's Lord?

1056
01:51:14,840 --> 01:51:16,439
Konur is right.

1057
01:51:16,800 --> 01:51:19,399
I wish revenge in every breath I take, Bey.

1058
01:51:20,840 --> 01:51:22,119
However..

1059
01:51:23,560 --> 01:51:25,959
Bursa is impassable.

1060
01:51:34,040 --> 01:51:35,439
What are we going to do, Bey?

1061
01:51:36,560 --> 01:51:39,519
We don't need to hit Bursa to hit its Lord.

1062
01:51:42,320 --> 01:51:44,119
The Lord is Byzantine itself.

1063
01:51:47,280 --> 01:51:49,599
And the closes Byzantine place is..

1064
01:51:50,880 --> 01:51:52,679
Kopruhisar.

1065
01:51:54,280 --> 01:51:57,119
They also use it as a stronghold to attack us.

1066
01:52:00,040 --> 01:52:01,999
If we take Kopruhisar..

1067
01:52:02,760 --> 01:52:05,839
Then we would deal great damage.

1068
01:52:08,640 --> 01:52:10,519
Lord Valens.

1069
01:52:11,720 --> 01:52:14,359
He already thinks about finishing us off.

1070
01:52:15,520 --> 01:52:18,199
However, he will break instead.

1071
01:52:20,880 --> 01:52:23,639
We will see..

1072
01:52:24,120 --> 01:52:26,719
After the support from Sultan arrives.

1073
01:52:30,240 --> 01:52:32,039
Are we allowed, Bey?

1074
01:52:32,440 --> 01:52:34,119
Come, Baysungur.

1075
01:52:37,320 --> 01:52:38,239
Bey.

1076
01:52:39,040 --> 01:52:40,719
Our scouts have sent word.

1077
01:52:41,480 --> 01:52:42,999
Tell me.

1078
01:52:44,080 --> 01:52:46,439
The aid, sent from Sultan..

1079
01:52:48,840 --> 01:52:51,879
Has been hit by Lord Vales and Nayman.

1080
01:53:06,320 --> 01:53:09,319
Nayman's Base

1081
01:53:09,680 --> 01:53:13,919
The future of these lands,
are in our hands now, Nayman.

1082
01:53:15,960 --> 01:53:18,599
Sultan Mesut's legions have been destroyed.

1083
01:53:19,920 --> 01:53:22,879
And Osman..

1084
01:53:24,560 --> 01:53:27,519
Osman is a dead man.

1085
01:53:30,960 --> 01:53:34,359
We will make a celebration in honor of this.

1086
01:53:36,400 --> 01:53:38,399
Servants.

1087
01:53:44,200 --> 01:53:47,879
The Lord of Kopruhisar,
my friend Petrus is also with us.

1088
01:53:56,040 --> 01:53:59,519
You have freed me and Kopruhisar,
from such a trouble..

1089
01:53:59,760 --> 01:54:01,559
Your arrival has been a grace.

1090
01:54:01,880 --> 01:54:04,039
Kopruhisar is free now, because of you.

1091
01:54:07,080 --> 01:54:10,439
You have teached those barbaric Turks their place.

1092
01:54:10,520 --> 01:54:13,039
Our alliance with Nayman..

1093
01:54:14,840 --> 01:54:19,079
Has become the end of Osman, Lord Petrus.

1094
01:54:23,920 --> 01:54:27,799
Osman is in a tight corner now.

1095
01:54:31,240 --> 01:54:33,559
I will put the collar on his neck.

1096
01:54:36,640 --> 01:54:39,199
I have plundered Osman's tribes.

1097
01:54:39,760 --> 01:54:43,399
Killed his people, his soldiers.

1098
01:54:46,400 --> 01:54:48,719
Osman can not move now.

1099
01:54:51,640 --> 01:54:53,959
That shepherd..

1100
01:54:54,760 --> 01:54:57,439
Has to compromise with us.

1101
01:55:00,000 --> 01:55:02,839
He will surrender.

1102
01:55:03,800 --> 01:55:06,719
I will make him my slave.

1103
01:55:07,560 --> 01:55:10,079
That is what they deserve, my Lord.

1104
01:55:11,440 --> 01:55:13,199
Slavery.

1105
01:55:14,760 --> 01:55:18,919
Then, as righteous winners..

1106
01:55:20,560 --> 01:55:22,359
We shall celebrate.

1107
01:55:24,000 --> 01:55:26,519
-With meat?
-Yes, meat.

1108
01:55:57,120 --> 01:55:59,879
-What will we do now, Bey?
-What do you think, Boran?

1109
01:56:00,720 --> 01:56:02,719
War needs support.

1110
01:56:03,360 --> 01:56:04,639
Ivaz Bey is right.

1111
01:56:05,240 --> 01:56:06,959
No aid means no war.

1112
01:56:09,480 --> 01:56:12,959
All those moves done in Konya
was going to provide us this benefit.

1113
01:56:18,720 --> 01:56:20,519
As you know..

1114
01:56:20,960 --> 01:56:23,279
Better than me as well..

1115
01:56:26,520 --> 01:56:27,799
However..

1116
01:56:28,680 --> 01:56:31,879
For war..

1117
01:56:32,360 --> 01:56:35,119
First, you need a heart to walk on that path.

1118
01:56:39,880 --> 01:56:42,079
In times like these..

1119
01:56:43,360 --> 01:56:45,199
Are we going to lose our hopes?

1120
01:56:50,360 --> 01:56:52,119
Osman Bey.

1121
01:56:52,640 --> 01:56:56,439
You command..

1122
01:56:56,960 --> 01:57:00,239
We will die not once,
but thousand times in your path.

1123
01:57:06,080 --> 01:57:08,159
What is your order, Bey?

1124
01:57:15,440 --> 01:57:18,199
They break our valiants..

1125
01:57:19,360 --> 01:57:20,919
Leave us scarred..

1126
01:57:22,080 --> 01:57:25,119
They want us to die..

1127
01:57:25,680 --> 01:57:28,279
By shooting aid coming from Sultan Mesut.

1128
01:57:32,320 --> 01:57:34,679
This is the greatest blow they did.

1129
01:57:36,240 --> 01:57:40,199
Why would they be scared of us?
Why would they hold back?

1130
01:57:40,400 --> 01:57:42,279
Bey, they inflicted many blows..

1131
01:57:42,840 --> 01:57:44,799
We need time to heal.

1132
01:57:44,920 --> 01:57:46,719
No.

1133
01:57:51,280 --> 01:57:53,519
The most dangerous wolf..

1134
01:57:55,480 --> 01:57:57,199
Is an injured wolf.

1135
01:58:00,160 --> 01:58:02,639
They do not expect us to make a move now.

1136
01:58:04,600 --> 01:58:08,119
Now, they are enjoying themselves
and waiting for us to die.

1137
01:58:10,360 --> 01:58:12,999
This is the right time to make a move.

1138
01:58:14,640 --> 01:58:18,959
Konur! Do you have the map of Kopruhisar
which we took in return for the ink?

1139
01:58:19,040 --> 01:58:21,879
I never left it Bey, in case we would need it.

1140
01:58:22,040 --> 01:58:24,039
-Nice. Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

1141
01:58:24,120 --> 01:58:28,279
They will face us with those big shields,
after passing the gates.

1142
01:58:28,480 --> 01:58:31,999
Inform all valiants ready the spears.

1143
01:58:32,520 --> 01:58:35,159
As you command, Bey.

1144
01:58:37,240 --> 01:58:39,159
Are we sure, Bey?

1145
01:58:41,280 --> 01:58:42,999
We are sure.

1146
01:58:45,720 --> 01:58:47,999
We are so sure about this.

1147
01:58:49,560 --> 01:58:51,079
We will move to the walls..

1148
01:58:51,720 --> 01:58:53,879
At the nightfall.

1149
01:58:56,120 --> 01:58:58,199
When all guards fall asleep...

1150
01:58:59,840 --> 01:59:01,839
We will attack.

1151
01:59:02,600 --> 01:59:04,439
As you command.

1152
01:59:12,200 --> 01:59:13,919
Thanks to Allah.

1153
01:59:14,080 --> 01:59:17,239
-Thank you, Soldiers! Attack!.
-Both of you are quite good.

1154
01:59:17,400 --> 01:59:18,439
Thanks to Allah.

1155
01:59:18,520 --> 01:59:21,199
But this stage is very important.

1156
01:59:21,280 --> 01:59:23,719
You know, Malhun Hatun.

1157
01:59:24,360 --> 01:59:28,879
You should protect both yourself and your baby.

1158
01:59:30,200 --> 01:59:31,999
You're right.

1159
01:59:32,520 --> 01:59:35,199
I had better be more careful.

1160
01:59:35,560 --> 01:59:39,119
Alright then. You take more rest.

1161
01:59:39,440 --> 01:59:42,679
And I'll go visit the healing tents.

1162
01:59:42,840 --> 01:59:44,799
Thank you, Dark Midwife

1163
02:00:00,120 --> 02:00:01,599
Dark Midwife.

1164
02:00:04,760 --> 02:00:06,199
Malhun.

1165
02:00:07,640 --> 02:00:11,239
-Are you alright?
-I'll give you some privacy, my Bey.

1166
02:00:23,000 --> 02:00:24,759
Malhun?

1167
02:00:26,440 --> 02:00:29,359
-My Osman...
-Malhun.

1168
02:00:30,600 --> 02:00:33,639
-Are you alright?
-I'm good.

1169
02:00:34,760 --> 02:00:36,559
My Osman..

1170
02:00:37,360 --> 02:00:39,359
During these dark times

1171
02:00:39,640 --> 02:00:42,119
...I've got great news.

1172
02:00:47,600 --> 02:00:49,239
Are you..

1173
02:00:52,280 --> 02:00:54,999
-Pregnant?
-I am.

1174
02:00:56,640 --> 02:00:59,279
Really? Is this real?

1175
02:00:59,600 --> 02:01:03,719
Praise be!
Praise be!

1176
02:01:03,800 --> 02:01:06,359
Amazing news it is!

1177
02:01:06,640 --> 02:01:08,079
Malhun.

1178
02:01:08,560 --> 02:01:11,399
Oh Malhun... Oh..

1179
02:01:12,200 --> 02:01:13,679
Malhun.

1180
02:01:14,240 --> 02:01:16,159
Thanks to Allah.

1181
02:01:16,640 --> 02:01:18,599
Thanks to Allah.

1182
02:01:25,920 --> 02:01:27,799
I got good news...

1183
02:01:29,520 --> 02:01:34,359
...and survived tough things.
But none of them...

1184
02:01:37,160 --> 02:01:40,319
...made me as happy as this did.

1185
02:01:41,400 --> 02:01:43,359
Thanks to Allah.

1186
02:01:44,840 --> 02:01:48,639
May Allah let us have a healthy baby.

1187
02:01:49,040 --> 02:01:51,079
Amen, my Osman. Amen.

1188
02:01:51,200 --> 02:01:53,919
May it put eternal delight in our hearts.

1189
02:01:55,840 --> 02:01:57,439
Now...

1190
02:01:57,920 --> 02:02:00,559
Another baby is coming, huh?

1191
02:02:01,320 --> 02:02:03,799
Then we can't fit in our lands.

1192
02:02:04,360 --> 02:02:06,239
We need new conquests.

1193
02:02:10,200 --> 02:02:11,559
Malhun.

1194
02:02:13,640 --> 02:02:15,799
Tonight, If Allah permits...

1195
02:02:16,400 --> 02:02:18,759
...we will conquer Kopruhisar.

1196
02:02:20,280 --> 02:02:22,719
If Allah permits, my Osman.

1197
02:02:22,920 --> 02:02:24,559
If Allah permits.

1198
02:02:41,600 --> 02:02:43,439
Don't forget what I said.

1199
02:02:43,720 --> 02:02:45,879
Keep your eyes on Sultan Mesut.

1200
02:02:46,040 --> 02:02:49,959
Watch his every moment and
every move and let me know.

1201
02:02:50,400 --> 02:02:52,959
And you will go to Bursa.

1202
02:02:53,480 --> 02:02:56,239
I want to know everything about Lord Valens.

1203
02:02:58,400 --> 02:02:59,919
Leave now.

1204
02:03:01,640 --> 02:03:02,799
Aral.

1205
02:03:03,760 --> 02:03:06,839
Get prepared, we will set out too.

1206
02:03:08,120 --> 02:03:10,319
Where will we go sir?

1207
02:03:10,560 --> 02:03:14,679
I'm not here for Konya alone,
I'm here in the name of the owner of all the lands.

1208
02:03:18,680 --> 02:03:21,199
We will go to Frontiers to Yenisehir.

1209
02:03:29,280 --> 02:03:32,679
Konur, there are four passages here.

1210
02:03:33,320 --> 02:03:37,359
You and infantries behind you will pass these passages.

1211
02:03:50,720 --> 02:03:53,919
When you sneak inside, you will shut the gate first.

1212
02:03:55,400 --> 02:03:59,239
So that soldiers cannot come towards us.

1213
02:04:08,880 --> 02:04:12,039
You will use the passages in the north.

1214
02:04:12,400 --> 02:04:13,759
Yes my Bey.

1215
02:04:22,560 --> 02:04:26,039
You will go this way, you know what to do.

1216
02:04:26,800 --> 02:04:27,999
Come on.

1217
02:05:21,680 --> 02:05:24,759
Boran and Cerkutay, you will come with me.

1218
02:05:29,000 --> 02:05:31,159
We will go to the Lord's room.

1219
02:05:31,520 --> 02:05:33,639
In secret, and silently.

1220
02:06:48,080 --> 02:06:51,799
They are sleeping peacefully out of joy as they hit us.

1221
02:06:52,240 --> 02:06:55,359
But we will wake them up with the sound of swords.

1222
02:07:12,960 --> 02:07:16,039
My Bey, if you permit, let me stay behind you.

1223
02:07:16,280 --> 02:07:17,439
Of course.

1224
02:07:17,540 --> 02:07:21,019
You're here to become our companion again,
Balaban, thank you.

1225
02:07:42,720 --> 02:07:45,159
Tell me, any news from the Lord?

1226
02:07:45,320 --> 02:07:46,719
Not yet, Bey.

1227
02:07:47,000 --> 02:07:50,559
And when they come,
they will find us instead, my Bey.

1228
02:07:51,560 --> 02:07:54,199
Exactly.

1229
02:08:12,480 --> 02:08:16,119
-Sir, guards are missing.
-They must've fallen asleep.

1230
02:08:29,840 --> 02:08:31,279
Light the candles.

1231
02:08:36,840 --> 02:08:39,519
Pull the soldiers back to the villages.

1232
02:08:40,000 --> 02:08:41,719
Osman is gone now.

1233
02:08:42,680 --> 02:08:44,759
He also doesn't have the power to fight.

1234
02:08:45,880 --> 02:08:48,639
He is too worn-out to come to Kopruhisar Castle.

1235
02:08:50,680 --> 02:08:52,639
Osman is done.

1236
02:08:59,240 --> 02:09:01,519
Welcome, dear Lord.

1237
02:09:08,440 --> 02:09:10,039
Drop it.

1238
02:09:13,640 --> 02:09:15,919
What are you doing in my castle?

1239
02:09:16,560 --> 02:09:18,359
You are now..

1240
02:09:21,200 --> 02:09:22,839
In my property.

1241
02:09:25,440 --> 02:09:27,719
Now what did you discuss..

1242
02:09:29,240 --> 02:09:31,439
With Nayman and Valens?

1243
02:09:34,920 --> 02:09:38,439
Did you...
Did you celebrate?

1244
02:09:40,840 --> 02:09:43,719
-W..we..
-Of course you did.

1245
02:09:44,520 --> 02:09:45,839
You definitely did.

1246
02:09:48,680 --> 02:09:50,439
You burnt down the tents.

1247
02:09:50,560 --> 02:09:52,639
Burnt down the villages.

1248
02:09:52,840 --> 02:09:54,639
Killed innocents.

1249
02:09:55,840 --> 02:09:58,759
And broke Osman's arms and legs and left him helpless.

1250
02:10:03,400 --> 02:10:07,079
You also attacked the supplies coming from Konya.

1251
02:10:10,640 --> 02:10:13,439
And Osman was left without a branch to hold on to.

1252
02:10:14,160 --> 02:10:17,879
You killed him, ended him..

1253
02:10:30,400 --> 02:10:32,479
Now look if he's dead.

1254
02:10:51,040 --> 02:10:53,239
Come here.

1255
02:10:54,360 --> 02:10:56,279
Get up.

1256
02:10:57,120 --> 02:10:59,239
Stand

1257
02:11:00,080 --> 02:11:01,959
Come here.

1258
02:11:02,240 --> 02:11:04,999
Come! Stand up!

1259
02:11:05,640 --> 02:11:07,839
Come here.. Stand up!

1260
02:11:08,000 --> 02:11:11,519
You killed many innocent people!
You killed many innocent people!

1261
02:11:11,960 --> 02:11:13,119
Come here...

1262
02:11:13,800 --> 02:11:15,359
Stand

1263
02:11:15,840 --> 02:11:18,239
Stand up! Stand up!

1264
02:11:20,880 --> 02:11:23,399
You won this time, Osman.

1265
02:11:24,280 --> 02:11:26,919
But... you...

1266
02:11:27,400 --> 02:11:30,279
-...and your generation...
-We will always be on these lands!

1267
02:11:31,720 --> 02:11:34,839
But your names will not even
be remembered in the future.

1268
02:11:46,840 --> 02:11:48,559
Your time has come.

1269
02:12:08,160 --> 02:12:10,759
Place the glorious flag of Kayi everywhere!

1270
02:12:11,480 --> 02:12:15,359
Tell everyone that Kopruhisar
is the property of Turks!

1271
02:12:16,880 --> 02:12:18,679
Tell the cruel..

1272
02:12:19,080 --> 02:12:21,799
...that Osman Bey is coming for them!

1273
02:12:23,000 --> 02:12:33,839
Allah is the greatest!

1274
02:12:34,193 --> 02:12:40,163
Visit our website for more: turkision.com